{"ref":"BDB, מַמְלָכוּת","hw":"מַמְלָכוּת","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְלָכוּת</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. kingdom, dominion, reign (</strong>on form cf. We <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.28\">1 S 15:28</a> Dr<sup>ad loc. id.</sup><strong>)</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְלְכוּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:12\" href=\"/Joshua.13.12\">Jos 13:12</a> + 8 times;<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>kingdom</em> of Og <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:12\" href=\"/Joshua.13.12\">Jos 13:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:30\" href=\"/Joshua.13.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:31\" href=\"/Joshua.13.31\">31</a>; of Sihon v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:27\" href=\"/Joshua.13.27\">27</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>dominion, royal power</em> c. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרַע מֵעַל</span> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.28\">1 S 15:28</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵשִׁיב לְ</span> (hum. subj.) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.3\">2 S 16:3</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׁבִּית</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:4\" href=\"/Hosea.1.4\">Ho 1:4</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>reign</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרֵאשִׁית מַמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 26:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.26.1\">Je 26:1</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַמְלָכָה</span> <strong>3</strong>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכוּת</span> <strong>2</strong>).","next":"BDB, מַלְכִּיאֵל","prev":"BDB, מַמְלָכָה"}